    "name": "Rusted Sea",
    "steam_appid": 2722780,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722780/extras/1f2e69878bc03f36df7f2d22b0796f75.poster.avif?t=1754594309\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722780/extras/1f2e69878bc03f36df7f2d22b0796f75.webm?t=1754594309\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722780/extras/1f2e69878bc03f36df7f2d22b0796f75.mp4?t=1754594309\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE EARTH's BEEN BLOWN TO SMITHEREENS...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three years after a devastating war between the Syndicate of Sentients and the ruthless Robotic Regime, Earth's surface lies in ruin, patrolled by cold steel sentries. Humanity survives only in the underwater fallout shelter known as H2OME. Now, two battle-hardened divers must embark on a final mission to infiltrate the Regime\u2019s secret undersea missile silo and strike back. The sea is rusted, the pressure is rising, and the future of mankind rests in your hands. Welcome to <i><strong>Rusted Sea</strong></i><strong>!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UNLIKELY HEROES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start the game as Cade Callahan - a war vet sent on a top secret undersea mission to save humanity - but when disaster strikes, he finds himself stranded and at the mercy of ruthless and menacing swarms of BotFish.\u00a0 Repair and defend your sub while establishing radio communication with your wingwoman Finn so she can attempt to find you - the fate of the Human Species relies on your rescue.\u00a0 \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722780/extras/5479967556c725f0bab2dc7437035fef.poster.avif?t=1754594309\" width=400 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722780/extras/5479967556c725f0bab2dc7437035fef.webm?t=1754594309\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722780/extras/5479967556c725f0bab2dc7437035fef.mp4?t=1754594309\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Next, play as Finn Fontane - a penguin Navy Seal sent to Cade's rescue.\u00a0 Use your FINNFLUENCE ability to control other sea creatures - using their unique abilities to solve puzzles and ultimately locate and rescue your teammate Cade.\u00a0 Then, work together to find and infiltrate an enemy missile silo to launch a surprise attack on the The Bot HQ.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HARVEST NUKELIUM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722780/extras/f96e5dd1dc7a97871e5790fb4005709a.poster.avif?t=1754594309\" width=400 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722780/extras/f96e5dd1dc7a97871e5790fb4005709a.webm?t=1754594309\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722780/extras/f96e5dd1dc7a97871e5790fb4005709a.mp4?t=1754594309\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search for and harvest Nukelium - a rare undersea radioactive mineral - in order to restore power to critical wartime-era facilities that will help you accomplish your mission.\u00a0 But be careful, Nukelium also attracts the deadly BotFIsh.\u00a0\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Harness Unique Abilities of Sea LIfe</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722780/extras/53b5d083d9420e63d0806d45ce013400.poster.avif?t=1754594309\" width=400 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722780/extras/53b5d083d9420e63d0806d45ce013400.webm?t=1754594309\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722780/extras/53b5d083d9420e63d0806d45ce013400.mp4?t=1754594309\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize orcas and their echolocation to find your way around the undersea canyons of Rusted Sea.\u00a0 Discover unique tricks of other sea creatures along the way!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore, survive, and save humans in this fun and immersive story-driven action adventure game - what are you waiting for, get lost in Rusted Sea today! </h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722780/extras/1f2e69878bc03f36df7f2d22b0796f75.poster.avif?t=1754594309\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722780/extras/1f2e69878bc03f36df7f2d22b0796f75.webm?t=1754594309\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722780/extras/1f2e69878bc03f36df7f2d22b0796f75.mp4?t=1754594309\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE EARTH's BEEN BLOWN TO SMITHEREENS...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three years after a devastating war between the Syndicate of Sentients and the ruthless Robotic Regime, Earth's surface lies in ruin, patrolled by cold steel sentries. Humanity survives only in the underwater fallout shelter known as H2OME. Now, two battle-hardened divers must embark on a final mission to infiltrate the Regime\u2019s secret undersea missile silo and strike back. The sea is rusted, the pressure is rising, and the future of mankind rests in your hands. Welcome to <i><strong>Rusted Sea</strong></i><strong>!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UNLIKELY HEROES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start the game as Cade Callahan - a war vet sent on a top secret undersea mission to save humanity - but when disaster strikes, he finds himself stranded and at the mercy of ruthless and menacing swarms of BotFish.\u00a0 Repair and defend your sub while establishing radio communication with your wingwoman Finn so she can attempt to find you - the fate of the Human Species relies on your rescue.\u00a0 \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722780/extras/5479967556c725f0bab2dc7437035fef.poster.avif?t=1754594309\" width=400 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722780/extras/5479967556c725f0bab2dc7437035fef.webm?t=1754594309\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722780/extras/5479967556c725f0bab2dc7437035fef.mp4?t=1754594309\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Next, play as Finn Fontane - a penguin Navy Seal sent to Cade's rescue.\u00a0 Use your FINNFLUENCE ability to control other sea creatures - using their unique abilities to solve puzzles and ultimately locate and rescue your teammate Cade.\u00a0 Then, work together to find and infiltrate an enemy missile silo to launch a surprise attack on the The Bot HQ.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HARVEST NUKELIUM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722780/extras/f96e5dd1dc7a97871e5790fb4005709a.poster.avif?t=1754594309\" width=400 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722780/extras/f96e5dd1dc7a97871e5790fb4005709a.webm?t=1754594309\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722780/extras/f96e5dd1dc7a97871e5790fb4005709a.mp4?t=1754594309\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search for and harvest Nukelium - a rare undersea radioactive mineral - in order to restore power to critical wartime-era facilities that will help you accomplish your mission.\u00a0 But be careful, Nukelium also attracts the deadly BotFIsh.\u00a0\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Harness Unique Abilities of Sea LIfe</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722780/extras/53b5d083d9420e63d0806d45ce013400.poster.avif?t=1754594309\" width=400 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722780/extras/53b5d083d9420e63d0806d45ce013400.webm?t=1754594309\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722780/extras/53b5d083d9420e63d0806d45ce013400.mp4?t=1754594309\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize orcas and their echolocation to find your way around the undersea canyons of Rusted Sea.\u00a0 Discover unique tricks of other sea creatures along the way!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore, survive, and save humans in this fun and immersive story-driven action adventure game - what are you waiting for, get lost in Rusted Sea today! </h2>",
    "short_description": "RUSTED SEA is a undersea action-adventure puzzle game where you\u2019ll dive into a post-apocalyptic ocean as two unlikely heroes: a stranded submarine pilot and his fearless wingwoman \u2014 a penguin sent to rescue him. Navigate depths, control sea creatures, and outwit deadly BotFish to save Humankind!",
